      "expected_output": "pre-commit-check.py新增Check I(阿黑越权)+Check J(正式报告目录)，越权操作被阻断exit≠0"
    },
    {
      "id": "A3",
      "file": "代码文件/监督机制/release_gate.py",
      "description": "新建发布闸门脚本：聚合pre-commit+checklist+redline+deployment+PDF版式+web dry-run，全部PASS才允许覆盖正式目录和上传",
      "code_level": "L1",
      "change": "新建release_gate.py，串联6项闸门检查(pre-commit/checklist/redline/deployment/pdf_style/web_dryrun)，输出统一PASS/FAIL报告",
